  "item_short_desc": "<p>Look sharp and stay ready for action with Rothco&rsquo;s Lightweight Tactical Button-Up Shirt, designed to meet the demands of law enforcement, first responders, and security professionals. This tactical shirt is crafted from lightweight ripstop material, offering a balance of comfort and durability. The fabric is treated with a stain-resistant barrier to protect against permanent blemishes while on duty. For enhanced mobility, the shirt features gusseted sleeves, allowing for unrestricted movement in any situation.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "133043",
  "description": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Look sharp and stay ready for action with Rothco&rsquo;s Lightweight Tactical Button-Up Shirt, designed to meet the demands of law enforcement, first responders, and security professionals. This tactical shirt is crafted from lightweight ripstop material, offering a balance of comfort and durability. The fabric is treated with a stain-resistant barrier to protect against permanent blemishes while on duty. For enhanced mobility, the shirt features gusseted sleeves, allowing for unrestricted movement in any situation. The concealed mic clips over each shoulder provide discreet communication options, and the 2 front chest pockets with pen slots ensure quick access to essentials like keys, phones, and wallets. The shirt also includes ventilated underarm grommet holes for breathability, sleeve roll tabs, and an epaulet kit with a badge tab for professional, puncture-free badge placement. Rothco&rsquo;s Lightweight Tactical Shirt is your go-to uniform for both function and style.</p>",
